{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/877551-hosting-a-exalted-3rd-edition-skype-game","id":877551,"title":"Hosting a Exalted 3rd Edition Skype Game","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-04-29T04:29:57-07:00","id":877551,"title":"Hosting a Exalted 3rd Edition Skype Game","content":"Hello All,<br /> <br /> I am looking players to run a Exalted 3<sup>rd</sup> Edition Skype game both new and experienced players are welcome. All I ask is that you have a concept of the kind of Solar Exalt you want to play, have patience as we adjust to the new system and gaming on Skype as a whole. Once I have a player group established I will work with you to identify a meeting time and a gaming night. For the start I am looking to do a bi-weekly gaming session.<br /> <br /> The campaign will ultimately start in Nexus but from there depending on player choices and feedback the story could transition to any number of locals and focuses. <b>So again I suggest you build the Exalt you want to play.</b><br /> <br /> If this sounds like a game you be interested in joining please post below or e-mail me and I will get back with you.<br /> <br /> Thank you<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11699-striderzero1","name":"StriderZero1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11699_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-30T12:53:32-07:00","id":878941,"title":"","content":"I do have a character build in mind (a beat-boxing ninja). Question: are you using the Skype site or app? Because that might be an issue for me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Crunch isn't a hobby; it's a calling.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1959-hexmeister-vic","name":"Hexmeister Vic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1959_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"764"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-30T13:34:25-07:00","id":878977,"title":"","content":"Hi, I'm interested and wondering what days and times you'd be playing, as well as your time zone. I have a Twilight sorcerer/crafter that I'd be interested in playing if the timing works out","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Wow I wish I had something cool to say here</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2227-dman1123","name":"dman1123","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2227_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-30T17:35:45-07:00","id":879124,"title":"","content":"I would be interested. Have an old wise-man style Zenith Lore Supernal/Sorceror.<br /> <br /> I have a game on alternating Friday/Saturday nights in meat space.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8762-waywardpaladin","name":"WaywardPaladin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-30T18:25:53-07:00","id":879150,"title":"","content":"Hello All,<br /> <br /> Hexmeister Vic, The character sounds fine reminds of Killer B from the base description I am going to assume your planning to play a night caste. As for the chat system used we can use any online communication system I used Skype in the description because that is the one I have right now but we can use Google+, Roll20 system chat, or whatever system everyone can access.<br /> <br /> dman1123, I am in the eastern time zone right now I can do any evening except Mondays and Thursdays due prior engagements the character sounds fine. I would like to do Sundays but any day except the days previously mentions I am open.<br /> <br /> WaywardPaladin, What nights and times do you have free and the lore heavy sorcerer would actually work well with the story I am developing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11699-striderzero1","name":"StriderZero1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11699_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-30T19:16:51-07:00","id":879178,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>StriderZero1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/877551-hosting-a-exalted-3rd-edition-skype-game?p=879150#post879150\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> WaywardPaladin, What nights and times do you have free and the lore heavy sorcerer would actually work well with the story I am developing.</div> </div> </div> </div>I am in Arizona. I get home around 5 PM so about 8 or so your time? Also since you want bi-weekly I could do Friday or Saturday if you ran it on the opposite weeks of my usual games.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8762-waywardpaladin","name":"WaywardPaladin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-30T20:47:31-07:00","id":879222,"title":"","content":"Saturday or Sunday works well for me","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Wow I wish I had something cool to say here</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2227-dman1123","name":"dman1123","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2227_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-01T17:16:20-07:00","id":879783,"title":"","content":"OK lets shoot a for a bi-weekly Saturday game if either of you know anyone else that might be interested in playing let me know I would like a circle of at least three to four players. Also what times are good for you on Saturday's? Additionally all three character concepts have been approved start thinking of a short back story for your characters the only requirements is it should end with &quot;an then I met her.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11699-striderzero1","name":"StriderZero1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11699_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-01T17:46:31-07:00","id":879803,"title":"","content":"I don't have anyone that I know of that will play, but around 7pm works for me. A podcast I'm part of records on saturday's so that'll be late enough that I don't run into any conflicts with them.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Wow I wish I had something cool to say here</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2227-dman1123","name":"dman1123","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2227_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-02T17:21:08-07:00","id":880596,"title":"","content":"Is everyone OK with 7:30PM?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11699-striderzero1","name":"StriderZero1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11699_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-02T19:17:18-07:00","id":880666,"title":"","content":"Hi. If it's alright with everyone, I'd be interested in playing. I live in Japan, so time zone wise, when It's 7:30PM Sat. on the East Coast, it's 8:30am Sunday in Tokyo. So a biweekly game could work for me. However I do have a preexisting commitment on my Sunday the 22nd, your Sat the 21st.<br /> <br /> Character questions:<ul><li>Would you want me to do a character concept with a caste that hasn't already been mentioned by the three other players?</li> <li>Are two characters of the same caste but different builds ok?</li> <li>are two characters with the same high level concept ok. b/c the nuts and bolts of how those characters get fleshed out would be different? i.e. two twilight sorcerer/crafters, but how the back story, personality, charms taken, other details might make them different from each other?</li> </ul><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7142-streetunderbamboo","name":"StreetUnderBamboo","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T17:54:20-07:00","id":882389,"title":"","content":"Everyone sorry for the late reply been a busy few days. The preexisting commits are understandable and we can work around that. Wayward needs to confirm what Saturdays he has available and we can setup the first session and do some character introductions and creation if needed. As for the the overlap of abilities I would prefer everyone pick a different caste but I understand having concept you want to play and not being able to so with that said as long as the concepts and skill are diverse enough that I don't end up with two occult heavy charm users. I am fine with it.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11699-striderzero1","name":"StriderZero1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11699_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T18:28:05-07:00","id":882402,"title":"","content":"Hey StreetUnderBamboo, I've got a night cast with Athletics supernal if you'd prefer to go Twilight.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Wow I wish I had something cool to say here</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2227-dman1123","name":"dman1123","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2227_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T18:28:34-07:00","id":882404,"title":"","content":"I'm new to exalted but i want to play<br /> i live in China so i'm one timezone away from StreetUnderBamboo and Sunday morning (Saturday evening for people in the USA) would also work for me<br /> I would like to play a mounted archer Dawn/Zenith or a Witch Doctor-Grappler Twilight/Zenith<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11671,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11671-dramaflo","user":"DraMaFlo","date":". 05-04-2016, 09:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11671-dramaflo","name":"DraMaFlo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11671_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-05T11:36:14-07:00","id":883060,"title":"","content":"I have my D&amp;D game this Saturday so I'm free on the 14th and every other Saturday after.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8762-waywardpaladin","name":"WaywardPaladin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-05T11:52:16-07:00","id":883072,"title":"","content":"I'd be interested if you're still looking for players<br /> <br /> Have an idea for an awareness dawn former prostitute who is surprisingly a brawler<br /> <br /> <br /> Strike that, I wait tables and Saturday night is basically a third of my week. Happy gaming guys!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5533,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5533-cameraobscura83","user":"CameraObscura83","date":".  Misread the time 05-05-2016, 02:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5533-cameraobscura83","name":"CameraObscura83","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5533_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"151"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-05T18:25:34-07:00","id":883366,"title":"","content":"Ok everyone our first game is on Saturday the 14th starting at 7:30 PM Eastern time have character concepts ready if anyone is having problems we can do some character generation before we start. This will be a chance for everyone myself included to get a feel for your characters, each other and start forming a circle. Your going to need teamwork to survive in Nexus. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <br /> <br /> The Players I have are:<br /> StreetUnderBamboo - Twilight<br /> WaywardPaladin - Zenith<br /> dman1123 - As a night or Twilight<br /> DraMaFlo- Dawn/Zenith or Twilight<br /> <br /> I have to be honest I don't want duplicate caste and with four players there are enough of caste to have a diverse circle can you four figure out among yourselves who is playing what caste also because I know what it is like to have idea and concept and not be able to play it the people that give up Twilight will gain a character creation perk that will be defined later to make up for loss.<br /> <br /> Once that is established I need a little back story about your characters the only requirements is it should end with &quot;an then I met her.&quot; (It can be as short or as long as need to explain your concept)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11699-striderzero1","name":"StriderZero1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11699_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-06T00:30:35-07:00","id":883542,"title":"","content":"Hi <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2227-dman1123\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar2227_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2227\" data-vbnamecard=\"2227\">dman1123</a>, and others. I'm still reading through the charms, sorcery, martial arts rules, etc. I think I could do one of a few concepts I have without choosing Twilight. So someone else can be Twilight cast.<br /> concepts:<ul><li>A charismatic adventurer from the west with insatiable wanderlust. (eclipse cast or twilight cast)</li> <li>A warrior who uses geomancy / sorcery to use the 5 elements to enhance his attacks and manipulate the environment. (dawn cast)</li> <li>A famous performer who enjoys the fame and the &quot;various opportunities&quot; it provides (zenith cast)</li> </ul><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":7142,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7142-streetunderbamboo","user":"StreetUnderBamboo","date":".  Only Zenith cast can have a supernatural performance ability. 05-08-2016, 02:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7142-streetunderbamboo","name":"StreetUnderBamboo","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-06T00:41:36-07:00","id":883551,"title":"","content":"Hi <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11699-striderzero1\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar11699_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"11699\" data-vbnamecard=\"11699\">StriderZero1</a>. Question about the backstory. The ending of &quot;and then I met her&quot; means that we don't specify any details about the person that we met at some time in the past? Or if we are allowed to provide some information about the person, how much is ok?<br /> <br /> I can think of a female character or two as part of my backstory, but then I'm supplying details about the person and what sort of relationship, activities we did together after meeting. So would that person just be part of my back story or fill your storyteller goal as well?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":7142,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7142-streetunderbamboo","user":"StreetUnderBamboo","date":". 05-06-2016, 04:22 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7142-streetunderbamboo","name":"StreetUnderBamboo","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-06T06:36:09-07:00","id":883693,"title":"","content":"Sorry for the lack better guidance earlier had to go back and review my notes. Your story should end with an then I met her you should have no details about her in your back story or meeting with her prior to the end of your story. So meeting her in chronological order should the most present event like the example below just end your story with her. Additionally when you exalt the Unconquered Sun should give this message or a variation of this message for story framing elements:<br /> <br /> &quot;This is not as it should be my son (or daughter). The world is out balance and war is coming. The trials ahead will be vast but you must prepare. However, you will not be alone I can give you this I exalt you. You must find me, heal me, save me from my enemies.&quot;<br /> <br /> Example story:<br /> Slade and Cain grew up chained to the orphan pirate galley rowing day and night on the smugglers ships The Saucy Mare. But destiny had more in store for Slade during a fateful night the Mare was attacked by the Dragon's Bane a pirate ship captained by Bloody Bones and everyone knew Bones didn't take prisoners or slaves alive he cared only plunder and with a crew of the undead rowing for him what use did he have for anything else? With the rudder damaged and the hull taking on water everyone knew they would have to repel boarders until they could catch the wind and hope to out run the Dragon's Bane. In a moment of absolute fear the Captain opened the hold and pressed steel into every galley slave's hands with the message of fight or die. As the battle ensued Cain was cut to pieces by Bloody Bones himself while Slade fought with wild abandon in hopes of avenging his little brother. Just as he closed the distance and prepared to face Bones a stray ember reached the firedust kegs stored on deck. The explosion rocked the ship and blasted Slade off the deck as he splashed in the water he felt the touch of the Unconquered Sun upon him, &quot;This is not as it should be my son. War is coming an we must prepare. You who have had so little I now task with so much and give so much more I exalt you. You must find me, heal me, save me from my enemies.&quot; Power burned within Slade as the dawn caste mark appeared on his forehead he blackout. Slade awoke on sandy beach coughing up water but still clutching his sword as his vision cleared he observed a set of long slender legs it was then I met her.<br /> <br /> If you need a physical description for her: She looks like a tanned skinned athletic woman in her early 20 who possesses a very vibrant beauty that is enhanced by a wild air that suggests she could dangerous as well as interesting if need arises. She has shoulder length dark hair streaked with white and adorned with accoutrements. .<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11699-striderzero1","name":"StriderZero1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11699_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-06T08:05:46-07:00","id":883794,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>StreetUnderBamboo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/877551-hosting-a-exalted-3rd-edition-skype-game?p=883542#post883542\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hi <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2227-dman1123\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar2227_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2227\" data-vbnamecard=\"2227\">dman1123</a>, and others. I'm still reading through the charms, sorcery, martial arts rules, etc. I think I could do one of a few concepts I have without choosing Twilight. So someone else can be Twilight cast.<br /> concepts:<ul><li>A charismatic adventurer from the west with insatiable wanderlust. (eclipse cast)</li> <li>A warrior who uses geomancy / sorcery to use the 5 elements to enhance his attacks and manipulate the environment. (dawn cast)</li> <li>A famous performer who enjoys the fame and the &quot;various opportunities&quot; it provides (eclipse / zenith cast)</li> </ul></div> </div> </div> </div>I think I'll go with the night caste idea, just because it'll be easier as a first time player to not have to worry about sorcery or crafting right away.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Wow I wish I had something cool to say here</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2227-dman1123","name":"dman1123","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2227_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-06T10:43:55-07:00","id":883894,"title":"","content":"Also any character sheets can be sent to <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#376443455e5352456d52455806775f58435a565e5b1954585a\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"acffd8dec5c8c9def6c9dec39decc4c3d8c1cdc5c082cfc3c1\">[email&#160;protected]</span></a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11699-striderzero1","name":"StriderZero1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11699_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-08T11:39:38-07:00","id":885528,"title":"","content":"Hi <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11671-dramaflo\" style=\"background