","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-09T04:59:39-07:00","id":886111,"title":"","content":"Hello everyone everything is looking good for starting up this Sat.<br /> The characters I have received are as follows:<br /> WaywardPaladin - Zenith<br /> dman1123 - Night<br /> DraMaFlo- Dawn","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11699-striderzero1","name":"StriderZero1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11699_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-10T13:27:39-07:00","id":887450,"title":"","content":"I may have to reschedule our first game moving it to the 28 of May due to shift change I will know more tomorrow. I sorry of the delay and inconveniences I will keep you posted.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11699-striderzero1","name":"StriderZero1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11699_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-10T18:57:08-07:00","id":887744,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>StriderZero1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/877551-hosting-a-exalted-3rd-edition-skype-game?p=887450#post887450\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I may have to reschedule our first game moving it to the 28 of May due to shift change I will know more tomorrow. I sorry of the delay and inconveniences I will keep you posted.</div> </div> </div> </div>Understandable, hope it all works out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Wow I wish I had something cool to say here</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2227-dman1123","name":"dman1123","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2227_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-10T19:49:47-07:00","id":887769,"title":"","content":"In a way, this is fortuitous. Our Friday Exalt game was looking to run this one time this Saturday since a friend of ours is having a going away party this Friday, he is leaving to another state.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8762-waywardpaladin","name":"WaywardPaladin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-11T08:28:06-07:00","id":888232,"title":"","content":"I am interested in playing a Twilight cast in your game, is it too late to get in?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-11T18:37:06-07:00","id":888733,"title":"","content":"First let shoot for the May 28th at 7:30 eastern time I have to work Saturday sadly. Secondly it is not to late to get in on the game but check with StreetUnderBamboo and see what caste he is playing if he is not playing a Twilight it is all yours if he doesn't answer you back by Friday its yours. <b>To play I need a short origin slash back story your story should end with an then I met her you should have no details about her in your back story or meeting with her prior to the end of your story</b>. So meeting her in chronological order should the most present event like the example below just end your story with her. <b>Additionally when you exalt the Unconquered Sun should give this message or a variation of this message for story framing elements:<br /> <br /> &quot;This is not as it should be my son (or daughter). The world is out balance and war is coming. The trials ahead will be vast but you must prepare. However, you will not be alone I can give you this I exalt you. You must find me, heal me, save me from my enemies.&quot;</b><br /> <br /> Example story:<br /> Slade and Cain grew up chained to the orphan pirate galley rowing day and night on the smugglers ships The Saucy Mare. But destiny had more in store for Slade during a fateful night the Mare was attacked by the Dragon's Bane a pirate ship captained by Bloody Bones and everyone knew Bones didn't take prisoners or slaves alive he cared only plunder and with a crew of the undead rowing for him what use did he have for anything else? With the rudder damaged and the hull taking on water everyone knew they would have to repel boarders until they could catch the wind and hope to out run the Dragon's Bane. In a moment of absolute fear the Captain opened the hold and pressed steel into every galley slave's hands with the message of fight or die. As the battle ensued Cain was cut to pieces by Bloody Bones himself while Slade fought with wild abandon in hopes of avenging his little brother. Just as he closed the distance and prepared to face Bones a stray ember reached the firedust kegs stored on deck. The explosion rocked the ship and blasted Slade off the deck as he splashed in the water he felt the touch of the Unconquered Sun upon him, &quot;This is not as it should be my son. War is coming an we must prepare. You who have had so little I now task with so much and give so much more I exalt you. You must find me, heal me, save me from my enemies.&quot; Power burned within Slade as the dawn caste mark appeared on his forehead he blackout. Slade awoke on sandy beach coughing up water but still clutching his sword as his vision cleared he observed a set of long slender legs it was then I met her.<br /> <br /> If you need a physical description for her: She looks like a tanned skinned athletic woman in her early 20 who possesses a very vibrant beauty that is enhanced by a wild air that suggests she could dangerous as well as interesting if need arises. She has shoulder length dark hair streaked with white and adorned with accoutrements. .<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11699-striderzero1","name":"StriderZero1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11699_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-11T23:34:33-07:00","id":888889,"title":"","content":"I've decided to go with the Eclipse cast and I'm about 50% done with character creation. I don't think I'll have time to finish the character until the weekend.<br /> <br /> I'm also fine if the the first game needs to get delayed till the 28th. (On the plus side, it would give everyone a chance to further flesh out details about their character.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7142-streetunderbamboo","name":"StreetUnderBamboo","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-12T02:57:11-07:00","id":888983,"title":"","content":"So.. do you need me to do anything else for my character?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11671-dramaflo","name":"DraMaFlo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11671_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-12T08:28:48-07:00","id":889136,"title":"","content":"DraMaFlo everything is good your done I will send you some stuff about your mount this weekend.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11699-striderzero1","name":"StriderZero1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11699_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-12T12:43:01-07:00","id":889293,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>StriderZero1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/877551-hosting-a-exalted-3rd-edition-skype-game?p=889136#post889136\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">DraMaFlo everything is good your done I will send you some stuff about your mount this weekend.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ok, Thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11671-dramaflo","name":"DraMaFlo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11671_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-15T04:00:19-07:00","id":891076,"title":"","content":"So, how are we going to play, besides using skype?<br /> Roll20?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11671-dramaflo","name":"DraMaFlo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11671_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-16T08:27:24-07:00","id":891754,"title":"","content":"I am open to suggestions. Currently I have skype setup but if everyone wants to use roll20 or whatever the google chat system is we can I am open?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11699-striderzero1","name":"StriderZero1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11699_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-16T10:16:35-07:00","id":891839,"title":"","content":"So question, would anyone not be okay with me recording audio for the podcast I'm part of? If so, I'm totally okay not recording it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Wow I wish I had something cool to say here</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2227-dman1123","name":"dman1123","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2227_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-16T11:42:37-07:00","id":891893,"title":"","content":"Sooo, noticed this super late. Would you have room for two more potentially? Both complete noobs to Exalted cept me reading over the basics of the system and watching a few hours of someone elses game on youtube. We understand the basic relationships between the different exalted but not much about the specifics of nations and whatnot. We could probably fill in the missing castes if you want.<br /> <br /> Skype Names:<br /> yig1015 (Yig)<br /> Noxxy31","signature":"","edited":{"userid":9236,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9236-yig1015w","user":"Yig1015w","date":". 05-16-2016, 03:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9236-yig1015w","name":"Yig1015w","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"182"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-17T05:43:31-07:00","id":892441,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>StriderZero1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/fo